  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with All-American spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a980911960f8a32f0bf92b-3a23bda5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and thinly slice.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are “popping” out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a980911960f8a32f0bf92b-02df3136.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the sweet potato is done, to the bowl with corn, add tomato, mixed salad leaves and mustard cider dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a980911960f8a32f0bf92b-6b354810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls.\n• Top with smokey sweet potato and sliced avocado.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes then drizzle with ranch dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a980911960f8a32f0bf92b-7f772759.jpeg"
    }
  ]
